  { inputCapability = "extension_admission_attested_scope"
  , inputClaim = "A statically linked infernix ExtensionSpec binds inference at the exact application and need, with CPU Deployments and CUDA DaemonSets derived from supplied lanes. Every rendered object has a scope introduced by attestation. The shipped AST checker judges native syntax and pragma nodes against its closed API before contributed source can link. The runner rebuilds a source-changed sibling with infernix removed from the actual linked list and observes UnboundCapability for the same nonce-bearing input. Independent literals judge the complete predecessor corpus, AST evasion pairs, merge refusals, opaque constructors and scope indices, runtime resources, scope labels, and consumed workflow output. Live infrastructure, child clusters, the UI language and compiler correctness are outside this claim."
